        <h1 class="Page__title">
<p>Velg full­finansierte studier fra Kristiania</p>
</h1>
        <div class="ArticlePage__hero">
            



<div id="4b7cd06a"></div>    <div class="HeroLegacy ">
        <div class="HeroLegacy__media">

                <figure class="HeroLegacy__image ">
                    <picture><source sizes="(max-width: 1135px) 100vw, (min-width: 1136px) 1136px" srcset="/contentassets/e4e7046c9e1f484bb4f53e739314e5e7/fullfinansierte-studier-hero.jpg?width=375&amp;rxy=0.54,0.38 375w, /contentassets/e4e7046c9e1f484bb4f53e739314e5e7/fullfinansierte-studier-hero.jpg?width=768&amp;rxy=0.54,0.38 768w, /contentassets/e4e7046c9e1f484bb4f53e739314e5e7/fullfinansierte-studier-hero.jpg?width=1136&amp;rxy=0.54,0.38 1136w, /contentassets/e4e7046c9e1f484bb4f53e739314e5e7/fullfinansierte-studier-hero.jpg?width=2272&amp;rxy=0.54,0.38 2272w" /><img alt="Nettstudent sitter i en studieb&#xE5;s med PC og smiler i kamera" loading="eager" src="/contentassets/e4e7046c9e1f484bb4f53e739314e5e7/fullfinansierte-studier-hero.jpg?width=1136&amp;rxy=0.54,0.38" /></picture>
                </figure>
<div class="HeroLegacy__imageCaption"><span>Foto: Terje Borud</span></div>        </div>
    </div>

        </div>
        <div class="Page__header">
            

                <div class="Page__intro">
<p>Vil du få relevant kompetanse uten å betale studieavgift? Våre fullfinansierte nettstudier innen helse, oppvekst og administrasjon gir deg kompetanse det er høy etterspørsel etter i arbeidslivet. Nettstudiene er på deltid og har fast oppstart.</p>
</div>
        </div>
    </div>
    <div class="Page__body ArticlePage__body">
        <div class="Richtext">
            
<section class="Richtext__block">
<div id="6c4271b8"><div class="wpzR7Ubo_xEutl52Zp75 DHCnDU0wRn7jK6giJOOZ"><div class="V8aOwwiJRFBxJgusm4aF"><div class="GUOxoAIAS7X__K3INkvA iMpK2rC3YIXyLMIJ0FpQ"><div class="lx1DYKTRWqfAmaRsQcAD"><h2 class="mOC0Y0kaFN6uPYipg6C5">Helse</h2><p class="LUrmZawhZ1LBHsiYiZIJ">Vil du jobbe med mennesker og bidra til bedre helse og livskvalitet? Her finner du nettstudier med fast oppstart vår og/eller høst.</p></div><ul class="yNGO7WHwhaEM3FcSwcNJ qfLA3b6B9Wn1nFrFWcfS"><li><div class="DpBBdJZCNvH11Iv1zDLu"><a href="/studier/fagskole/fagskole-paa-nett/helsekoordinator--fullfinansiert/" class="XezMfDvRba8HKhHr79wm B5Z4_vbRcPt248iwmQXi Ij1dPkiPlaTD3uo6se1x edl31Fo4Oj6a7JbI7uJy IUuKHagAD1zfQdGeQEQh GMFlTxWOaPaSRlpWaL1Q klC6xPNTZ6AQDOpmaCtZ" data-owned=""><div class="DdPYOTimBd1c8zDeoFgi LAgZMr1fyvbOVgj7_PsL"><span class="MUBYvmBUPBzTdaNqh8X9">Helsekoordinator - Fullfinansiert</span><span class="SvgIcon"><svg><use xlink:href="/dist/iconsSprite.ff403ecca.svg#sprite-arrow-right"></use></svg></span></div></a></div></li><li><div class="DpBBdJZCNvH11Iv1zDLu"><a href="/studier/fagskole/helsekoordinator--fullfinansiert/" class="XezMfDvRba8HKhHr79wm B5Z4_vbRcPt248iwmQXi Ij1dPkiPlaTD3uo6se1x edl31Fo4Oj6a7JbI7uJy IUuKHagAD1zfQdGeQEQh GMFlTxWOaPaSRlpWaL1Q klC6xPNTZ6AQDOpmaCtZ" data-owned=""><div class="DdPYOTimBd1c8zDeoFgi LAgZMr1fyvbOVgj7_PsL"><span class="MUBYvmBUPBzTdaNqh8X9">Helsekoordinator - Fullfinansiert (Bergen)</span><span class="SvgIcon"><svg><use xlink:href="/dist/iconsSprite.ff403ecca.svg#sprite-arrow-right"></use></svg></span></div></a></div></li><li><div class="DpBBdJZCNvH11Iv1zDLu"><a href="/studier/fagskole/fagskole-paa-nett/helseadministrasjonssekretar--fullfinansiert/" class="XezMfDvRba8HKhHr79wm B5Z4_vbRcPt248iwmQXi Ij1dPkiPlaTD3uo6se1x edl31Fo4Oj6a7JbI7uJy IUuKHagAD1zfQdGeQEQh GMFlTxWOaPaSRlpWaL1Q klC6xPNTZ6AQDOpmaCtZ" data-owned=""><div class="DdPYOTimBd1c8zDeoFgi LAgZMr1fyvbOVgj7_PsL"><span class="MUBYvmBUPBzTdaNqh8X9">Helseadministrasjonssekretær - Fullfinansiert</